// Real fighting companion: `alignment`/`with_agent`/`incorporeal`/
// `phantom_illusion` all omitted, which resolves them to their
// `#[serde(default)]` values (`Alignment::Owned(caster)`, `with_agent: true`,
// both booleans `false`) -- a genuine, hittable, AI-driven ally, not a
// decorative phantasm. Same recipe already-shipped NPC-cast summon abilities
// use for their own owned companions (see
// custom/dwarves/forgemaster/summon_iron_dwarf.ron and
// vampire/bloodmoon_heiress/summon.ron).
//
// No dedicated "fey" species exists anywhere in the engine (checked every
// species list in common/src/comp/body/{biped_small,biped_large}.rs -- zero
// fey/sprite/dryad-themed entries). `ShamanicSpirit` (`BipedSmall`) is the
// closest already-modeled "spirit" creature and already ships with a real
// combat loadout preset (`ShamanicSpiritSummon`, see
// custom/cursekeeper/summonshamanicspirit.ron, which also supplies the
// `skillset_config: Some(Rank5)` pairing reused here) -- reused as a stand-in
// for "a capricious wildland spirit" rather than adding a new `Body` variant.
//
// The sheet's `Concentration(60)` duration renders as a flat 60s expiry
// timer; there is no per-tick concentration-check mechanic to interrupt it
// early, so only that nuance is dropped, not the 60s number itself.
//
// Deviation from the two cited precedent files, flagged for reviewer
// attention: those omit `meta` entirely (so: no cooldown, unlimited recast)
// because they're short-lived utility/decoy summons. This is a real,
// multi-second combat ally on a resource-free `BasicSummon` cast (no
// `energy_cost` field exists on this variant), so a `cooldown` is added here
// to prevent free-spamming a full-health fighting companion.
BasicSummon(
    buildup_duration: 0.9,
    cast_duration: 0.6,
    recover_duration: 0.5,
    summon_info: Npc(
        summoned_amount: 1,
        summon_distance: (2.0, 3.0),
        body: BipedSmall((species: ShamanicSpirit, body_type: Male)),
        scale: None,
        has_health: true,
        use_npc_name: true,
        loadout_config: Some(ShamanicSpiritSummon),
        skillset_config: Some(Rank5),
        duration: Some((secs: 60, nanos: 0)),
    ),
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Primordial), cooldown: Some(45.0)),
)
